# Chatting in the demo world: completion, bold, moving between windows,
# and the Dark theme.
Output docs/gifs/chat.gif
Source dev/vhs/settings.tape

Hide
Type "clear; ./trout --demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Sleep 2.5s
Type "al"
Sleep 400ms
Tab
Type ": have you seen "
Ctrl+B
Type "trout"
Ctrl+B
Type "? mIRC, but in a terminal"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+N
Sleep 1.5s
Ctrl+Q
Sleep 1.5s
Ctrl+N
Sleep 1.5s
Ctrl+N
Sleep 1s
Alt+v
Sleep 1s
Down 7
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
